        "title": "Line Breaks, Emphasis and Importance",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 144697,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sometimes we want to format game HUD text with line breaks.</p><p>For example, this status panel would look much better if <code>Health: 100</code> appeared on one line, <code>Score: 2500</code> on the next, and so on.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;h1&gt;Player HUD&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt; Health: 100 Score: 2500 Level: 1 Lives: 3 &lt;/p&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 144698,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We can separate lines with the help of the <strong>line break tag</strong>: <code>br</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"70\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Player HUD\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" Health: 100\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Score: 2500\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Level: 1 \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Lives: 3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>, followed by <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 144699,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>&lt;br&gt;</code> is an <strong>empty tag</strong>. Empty tags have no closing tag and no content. They are also called self-closing tags.</p><p>Put together the line break tag.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"71\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Player HUD\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Health: 100\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Score: 2500\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Level: 1\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Lives: 3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 144700,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>There's an element for giving emphasis to text. It makes it <em>italic</em>. It's called the <code>em</code> element. Add <code>&lt;em&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"64\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Quest Log\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Current objective: \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Find the key\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Next area: Forest\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Enemies nearby: 3\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Treasure found: 1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;em&gt;</code>, followed by <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 144701,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To define texts as important, we use the <code>&lt;strong&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code> tags. They make text <strong>bold</strong>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"100\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Combat Alerts\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Incoming hit: \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"fireball\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Status: \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"strong\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"LOW HEALTH\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"strong\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;strong&gt;</code>, followed by <code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 144702,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What's the <code>&lt;br&gt;</code> tag for?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\">It gives emphasis to text</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\">It adds a line break</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">It adds a line break.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 144703,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which of these tags is an empty or self-closing tag?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;br&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;/em&gt;</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;p&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 144704,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which of these tags give emphasis to text?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;em&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;p&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;/p&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>&lt;em&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 144705,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What are the <code>&lt;strong&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code> tags for?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">They define text as important</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">They make the text unbreakable by line break</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">They define text as important.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 144706,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Give emphasis to the weapon name by adding the opening and closing emphasis tags.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"44\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" I just looted the \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Crystal Sword\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" from the chest.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;em&gt;</code>, followed by <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 144707,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Add a line break between <em>PlayerOne</em> and <em>Score: 9000</em> so <em>PlayerOne</em> is on one line and <em>Score: 9000</em> is below.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/br&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"18\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" PlayerOne \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" Score: 9000 \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 144708,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Give emphasis to the words in the second sentence.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"101\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My party gets nervous when the boss music starts. \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"I guess it's time\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" to dodge-roll a lot.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;em&gt;</code>, followed by <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
